OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772659301
OL,1,Vk4                               G4/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGBR TO REFUND PASSENGERS
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGFOR POOR SERVICE
OL,4,D
OL,5, British Rail has unveiled plans to
OL,6, refund passengers when trains are late.
OL,7,F
OL,8,FIt has launched its passenger's charter
OL,9,Fwhich sets separate performance targets
OL,10,Ffor different parts of the network.
OL,11,F
OL,12,FInterCity must get 90% of its peak hour
OL,13,Ftrains in on time; parts of Network
OL,14,FSouthEast have been set lower standards
OL,15,F
OL,16,FIf targets are not met, season ticket-
OL,17,Fholders will get discounts of up to 10%
OL,18,Fon renewal. Other passengers will get
OL,19,Fvouchers for 20% of the ticket price if
OL,20,Ftheir trains are over an hour late.
OL,21,F
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG04-03-92
OL,23,D] FMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49605
SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772659301
OL,1,Vk4                               G5/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGBR CHARTER
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pG"A PR CON"
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Consumers' Association has said the
OL,6, new BR charter is "little more than a
OL,7, glossy public relations con".
OL,9,FDirector John Beishon said 80%
OL,10,Fperformance targets were "abysmal".
OL,11,F"It's like admitting that one in five
OL,12,Fpassengers is guaranteed to step off a
OL,13,Ftrain angry and late," he said.
OL,15,FHe said the charter was virtually
OL,16,Fworthless as BR was still not legally
OL,17,Fliable for the costs caused by delays.
OL,19,FHe added that vouchers and petty
OL,20,Fdiscounts after a delay of more than an
OL,21,Fhour would be an insult to rail users.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG04-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
