PN,49608
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772659301
OL,1,Vk4                               G8/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGEC "MUST ACT" OVER
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Home Secretary has warned that
OL,6, right-wing extremism will thrive if
OL,7, the EC does not quickly halt a flood
OL,8, of illegal immigrants.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FKenneth Baker said the mass movement of
OL,11,Fpeople wishing to come to Europe as
OL,12,Fasylum seekers or illegal immigrants
OL,13,Fwas the biggest problem facing Europe.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FHe urged systems which discriminated
OL,16,Fbetween bogus and refugee asylum
OL,17,Fseekers to be put in place.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FSpeaking in Lisbon, he said Britain
OL,20,Freceived 45,000 applications last year
OL,21,Ffor political asylum.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG04-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
