OL,1,Vk4                               G9/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGUK'S FIRST TRIDENT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGSUBMARINE UNVEILED
OL,4,D
OL,5, Defence Secretary Tom King has unveiled
OL,6, Britain's first Trident submarine, HMS
OL,7, Vanguard, at the VSEL shipyard in
OL,8, Barrow-in-Furness, Cumbria.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FIt is one of four Tridents that will
OL,11,Freplace the Polaris submarines as the
OL,12,FUK's strategic nuclear deterrent from
OL,13,F1995. The programme has cost #10.7bn.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FLabour's foreign affairs spokesman
OL,16,FGerald Kaufman has said it is not clear
OL,17,Fa fourth Trident will be necessary -
OL,18,Fand a Labour government might cancel it
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe Liberal Democrats would reduce the
OL,21,Fnumber of warheads carried by Trident.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG04-03-92F/ teletextarchive.com
